Bundled FFmpeg
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product bundles an independently built executable of FFmpeg 8.1.2
(https://ffmpeg.org/), compiled from the official source by this project's own
build script (build/ffmpeg/build-minimal.sh). FFmpeg is licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

The build does NOT enable --enable-gpl or --enable-nonfree, so the bundled
binary is an LGPL build. The binary is shipped as a separate executable that is
unpacked next to the application data directory and may be replaced by the user,
which satisfies the LGPL relinking requirement.

FFmpeg is a trademark of Fabrice Bellard, originator of the FFmpeg project.

For the full list of compiled-in components and the license analysis, see
internal/ffmpeg/bin/FFMPEG-LICENSE.txt in the source distribution,
and https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html for FFmpeg's own licensing information.

